        "quote": "Chart J: For persons filing jointly, head of household, or qualifying surviving spouse—If your taxable income is $50,000 or more but not over $250,000 your tax is $3,756 plus 8.75% of excess over $50,000. If your taxable income is over $250,000 your tax is $21,256 plus 9.9% of excess over $250,000."
